                                "sense_id": "8374ff5e-8063-3f35-bdb1-5953932b0098",
                                "text": "Though they were attentive and inquisitive, it was long before fruit appeared; but undiscouraged, she, with prayer and faith, continued to sow beside all waters. Mrs. Judson was surprised at the native intelligence and reflecting minds possessed by some of the Burmese women."
